{"id":"636633","name":"芋泥牛乳汤圆","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/636633/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"荔浦芋头","amount":"适量"},{"name":"紫薯","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"纯牛奶","amount":"200ml"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"紫薯去皮切块备用。","img":"images/636633/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"芋头去皮洗净切块。","img":"images/636633/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"将芋头和紫薯放入破壁杯中。","img":"images/636633/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入清水和冰糖。","img":"images/636633/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"破壁机启动滋补糊模式至程序结束。","img":"images/636633/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"打好的芋泥加入纯牛奶。","img":"images/636633/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"牛肉水烧开放入汤圆煮至浮起。","img":"images/636633/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"煮好的汤圆盛入碗中。","img":"images/636633/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"倒入芋泥牛乳即可。","img":"images/636633/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/636633/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/636633/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：破壁机、煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}